OL,3,GNEWSAPerson injured as car crashes into
OL,4,Aestate agency
OL,5,
OL,6,FA person has been injured after a car
OL,7,Fthey were in crashed into a High Street
OL,8,Fshopfront.
OL,10,FThe vehicle smashed into the Longsons
OL,11,Festate agency branch in Watton,
OL,12,FNorfolk, shortly before 23:00 GMT on
OL,13,FSunday.
OL,15,FA second person was also freed from the
OL,16,Fblack Kia by fire crews.
OL,18,FNorfolk Police said the High Street was
OL,19,Fclosed at the junction with Dereham
OL,20,FRoad and would remain shut "for some
OL,21,Ftime".
